					"nextDialogs": [
						750141210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141210,
					"content": "怎么会发出这么奇怪的叫声，难道是生病了？行为也有反常的地方，看来得好好检查一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葵莉娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141211,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141212,
					"content": "小家伙，别心急，待会儿就轮到你了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葵莉娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141221,
					"content": "首先是你，你得跟我走，能听懂指令吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141213,
						750141215,
						750141217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葵莉娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141213,
					"content": "（点头。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141214,
					"content": "你这是从哪里学会的把戏？而且，难道你能听懂我的话？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葵莉娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141219,
					"content": "#这时，从外边传来一阵嘈杂的声响…\\n「谁把箱子打开了…喂！别抢！你们先别抢！待会儿葵莉娅要发脾气了！」\\n来不及确认发生了什么，先趁乱和{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}一起离开了营地…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 750141215,
					"content": "（摇头。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141216,
					"content": "你这是从哪里学会的把戏？而且，难道你能听懂我的话？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葵莉娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 750141217,
					"content": "（跟她走。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750141218,
					"content": "怪事，我还没说指令呢。难道你能听懂我的话？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750141219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葵莉娅"
				},
